+    // The ball is tangent to the restriction at its end: it rolls into the
+    // restriction from there, or it does not yet (it turns about that point,
+    // or stands while its other contact sweeps round it), or it leaves the
+    // restriction there, turning about its end until it can roll on the next
+    // edge. Does the free ball a little further on roll on the restriction?
+    const double h = std::max(100. * tolgui, 1.e-6);
+    Func.Unpin();
