+//=======================================================================
+// function : ChFi3d_NextEdges
+// purpose  : For a blend rolling on the edge of PC, whose face on the other
+//            side is that of HSref: at each vertex of the edge, the edge of
+//            that face that the ball rolls on next (not one across which the
+//            face continues tangentially), as its unit tangent there pointing
